>>
Rule 1 (shape_x and shape_y must have rank 1)
{shape_x : tensor, shape_y : tensor} |= ndim(shape_x) = 1 ∧ ndim(shape_y) = 1
>>
Rule 2 (shape_x and shape_y must have non-negative dimensions)
{shape_x : tensor, shape_y : tensor} |= (∀i ∈ [0, ndim(shape_x) - 1] : shape(shape_x, i) ≥ 0) ∧ (∀i ∈ [0, ndim(shape_y) - 1] : shape(shape_y, i) ≥ 0)
